# BillSplitter Frontend Environment Configuration
# For Render Static Site deployment:
# Configure this in Render Dashboard -> Frontend Static Site -> Environment Variables

# Backend API Web Service Base URL (do NOT include a trailing slash)
# Example for deployed Render service:
VITE_API_URL=https://billsplitter-api-1spb.onrender.com

# For local development with Vite dev server (npm run dev):
# You can leave VITE_API_URL empty or unset to automatically use Vite's built-in /api proxy:
# VITE_API_URL=
